│                          │   - 4 shared post-entangling RZ parameters for the same qubit pairs                       │
│                          │ - Keep the existing 7-qubit CZ chain to preserve expressivity.                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets higher `parameter_efficiency` (smaller `n_params`) while retaining high      │
│                          │ accuracy/generalization by maintaining entanglement and leaving re-uploading/repeating    │
│                          │ (fixed by the training loop) to recover representational power.                           │
