├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ rxrz_crz_sharedpair_czgrid                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Crossover design that combines:                                                           │
│                          │ - The current program’s “local expressivity + a few parametrized entanglers” idea (RX/RZ  │
│                          │ + controlled rotations).                                                                  │
│                          │ - The other program’s strong fixed entangling backbone (dense CZ cross-lattice).          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ To improve parameter efficiency (fewer trainable parameters per block) while keeping      │
│                          │ expressivity, single-qubit rotations use parameter sharing across qubit pairs:            │
│                          │ - RX shared on (0,1), (2,3), (4,5), (6,7) → 4 parameters                                  │
│                          │ - RZ shared on (0,1), (2,3), (4,5), (6,7) → 4 parameters                                  │
│                          │ - CRZ parametrized on (0,1), (2,3), (4,5), (6,7) → 4 parameters                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This yields 12 circuit parameters per block (so fewer total params than the current       │
│                          │ program’s ~20+), while retaining a high-connectivity fixed CZ scaffold for fast           │
│                          │ optimization and strong generalization.                                                   │
│                          │ Only EVOLVE-BLOCK (ANSATZ_SPEC) is changed.                                               │
