│                          │ of feature mapping and data re-uploading, but implements a fundamentally different        │
│                          │ entanglement strategy. The key insight is to create a more sophisticated layered approach │
│                          │ that alternates between local expressivity and global entanglement in a more structured   │
│                          │ way.                                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The novel approach uses:                                                                  │
│                          │ 1. ARY-RZ pattern for initial local expressivity with parameter sharing between symmetric │
│                          │ qubit pairs                                                                               │
│                          │ 2. Cross-layer entanglement using both CRZ (parametrized) and CZ (fixed) gates in a       │
│                          │ structured alternating pattern                                                            │
│                          │ 3. Mid-circuit RZ rotations to reshape phases before additional entanglement              │
│                          │ 4. A final local refinement layer with RY-RZ combinations                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This design improves parameter efficiency by using strategic parameter sharing while      │
│                          │ maintaining expressivity through structured entanglement. The alternating pattern of      │
│                          │ parametrized and fixed gates creates a more complex variational landscape while keeping   │
│                          │ the parameter count manageable. Unlike the previous approaches that used linear or sparse │
│                          │ entanglement, this implements a more sophisticated multi-layered entanglement pattern     │
│                          │ that better connects distant qubits through intermediate couplings.                       │
